The <ansi fg="command">spawn</ansi> command can be used in the following ways:

<ansi fg="yellow">Gold</ansi> - Spawns a pile of gold in the room.
    <ansi fg="command">spawn gold [amount]</ansi> - e.g. <ansi fg="command">spawn gold 100</ansi>
    <ansi fg="command">spawn container [name]</ansi> - e.g. <ansi fg="command">spawn container chest</ansi>
        Spawns a temporary lootable container in the room.

